      "id": "s6_t",
      "x": 188,
      "y": 762,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 66,
      "text": "Stood up the API gateway with a public address but its network interface\ninside the VNet, so it can accept Teams traffic from the internet and forward\nit privately to Foundry. Added token validation so only Bot Service traffic passes.",
